type: software
title: "PD-Design-Kit: Vertical PIN Ge-on-Si Photodetector Design Toolkit for 400GBASE-DR4 High-Speed Links"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-02"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21089184
url: "https://github.com/iabdul-aal/PD-design-kit"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Abdulaal
    given-names: Islam I.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-9300-3936"
    affiliation: "Electronics and Communications Engineering, Faculty of Engineering, Alexandria University"
abstract: >
  A cascaded multiphysics simulation pipeline for a waveguide-integrated Ge-on-Si
  vertical n-i-p photodiode with U-shaped electrode, targeting IEEE 802.3 400GBASE-DR4
  intra-datacenter links at O-band (1310 nm). Spans FDTD optical absorption, CHARGE
  carrier transport, MATLAB PAM-4 receiver modeling (53.125 GBd), and Lumerical
  INTERCONNECT compact model export. All performance metrics flow from solver outputs
  with zero hardcoded paper values. Includes PD design octagon (Razavi-equivalent
  radar chart), 2D design-space contour maps, sensitivity tornado analysis, and
  state-of-the-art literature benchmarking.
keywords:
  - photodetector
  - germanium-on-silicon
  - silicon photonics
  - vertical PIN
  - U-shaped electrode
  - O-band
